<title>RUSSIA: Russia Jan-July aluminium exports 1.509 mln T.</title>
<headline>Russia Jan-July aluminium exports 1.509 mln T.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian exports of primary aluminium and aluminium alloys over January-July were 1.509 million tonnes, Interfax news agency quoted the State Customs Committee as saying on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said July primary aluminium exports were 204,000 tonnes but gave no comparison. July exports of aluminium alloys were 16,660 tonnes.</p>
<p>Interfax did not say whether the figures included deliveries to former Soviet republics. Russia exports nearly all of its aluminium to Western markets.</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
